    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "West Bengal is one of the most productive agricultural states of India. It is the leading producer of rice, vegetables, and fish in the country.",
      "id": "91l3e98"
    },
    {
      "id": "m9q94k7",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Crop</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Details</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Rice</strong></p>",
            "<p>WB is the largest producer of rice in India — main food crop; grown in all districts</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Jute</strong></p>",
            "<p>WB is No. 1 producer in India; grown in Murshidabad, Nadia, North 24 Parganas</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Tea</strong></p>",
            "<p>WB is 2nd largest producer; Darjeeling tea is GI-tagged and world-famous</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Potato</strong></p>",
            "<p>Major vegetable crop; Hooghly, Bardhaman districts</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Vegetables</strong></p>",
            "<p>WB is leading vegetable producer in India</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Mustard / Oilseeds</strong></p>",
            "<p>Major Rabi crop in WB</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Litchi</strong></p>",
            "<p>North Bengal; Malda district famous for litchi</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Mango (Himsagar)</strong></p>",
            "<p>Malda &amp; Murshidabad; Himsagar and Fazli mango — GI tagged</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Betel Leaf (Paan)</strong></p>",
            "<p>WB grows large amount of betel leaf</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Fish (Hilsa)</strong></p>",
            "<p>WB is top fish-producing state; Hilsa (Ilish) is state fish; Rohu, Katla also major</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Silk (Murshidabad)</strong></p>",
            "<p>Murshidabad district produces large amount of Mulberry silk</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fnxgume",
      "type": "table",
