          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>[EXAM TIP] </strong>WB is India's No.1 producer of Rice, Jute, and Vegetables. For tea, WB is 2nd (after Assam). Darjeeling Tea has GI tag. These are asked every year in both SI and Constable exams.</p>"
          ]
        }
